<article class="demo demo--wide" data-cid="WB-TABL-009" data-name="单元格原位编辑" data-cat="TABL">
  <div class="demo__head"><span class="demo__name">单元格原位编辑</span></div>
  <p class="demo__note">适合：改价与盘点库存时不离开列表</p>
